---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Support" description="Answers to common questions about Departure: Fitness Quest, and how to contact us when you need more help.">
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Support</h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-12">Most questions are answered below. If yours is not, email us and we will help.</p>

      <!-- Contact card -->
      <div class="bg-surface/50 border border-surface-light/50 rounded-xl p-6 mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text mb-3">Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted mb-4">
          Email us at any time, and we will reply within one or two business days.
        </p>
        <a
          href="mailto:departure@engagequalia.com"
          class="inline-block text-primary hover:text-primary-light transition-colors font-medium"
        >
          departure@engagequalia.com
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-text-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed">

        <!-- Account & Sign-in -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text mb-4">Account &amp; Sign-in</h2>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">I can't sign in to my account</h3>
              <p>
                Check your email and password first. If you have forgotten your password, tap "Forgot Password" on the sign-in screen to reset it.
                If you still cannot get in, email us from the address on your account, and we will help you recover it.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">How do I change my email or password?</h3>
              <p>
                Open the <strong class="text-text">Settings</strong> tab in the app and tap <strong class="text-text">Edit Profile</strong>.
                You can change your name, username and profile photo there. To change your email or password, email us and we will do it for you.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">How do I delete my account?</h3>
              <p>
                Open the <strong class="text-text">Settings</strong> tab, scroll to the bottom and tap <strong class="text-text">Delete Account</strong>.
                This permanently removes your profile, workouts, photos, purchase records, and all other data. You can also email us at
                <a href="mailto:departure@engagequalia.com" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light transition-colors">departure@engagequalia.com</a>
                to request deletion. Full details are in our
                <a href="/privacy#account-deletion" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Workouts & Scoring -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text mb-4">Workouts &amp; Scoring</h2>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">My workout didn't earn XP</h3>
              <p>
                Departure has anti-cheat rules that keep experience points (XP) fair for everyone. A weight above the believable
                limit for its category earns no XP. A fourth or later workout in one day, or a sudden jump far past your usual
                volume, earns less XP. The app shows an alert that explains why. Every scoring rule is listed in the
                <strong class="text-text">Settings</strong> tab under <strong class="text-text">How Scoring Works</strong>.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">How do Personal Records (PRs) work?</h3>
              <p>
                A personal record (PR) is your best result on an exercise, and the app finds them for you. For lifts, it uses the
                Epley formula to estimate your one rep max, the most you could lift once, from the weight and reps you logged.
                For cardio, it tracks your longest session and your fastest time. A new PR earns bonus XP and can unlock gear.
                Your full PR history is in the <strong class="text-text">Trophy Case</strong>.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">Why is my rank not going up?</h3>
              <p>
                Your rank goes up with the total XP you have earned from all your workouts. There are 24 ranks: 8 titles, each
                with 3 levels. If your XP is rising but your rank is not, you are partway to the next level. Tap your rank on
                the Home screen to open the <strong class="text-text">Ranks</strong> page, which shows how much XP each rank needs.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Purchases -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text mb-4">Purchases</h2>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">I bought something but didn't receive it</h3>
              <p>
                Tap <strong class="text-text">Restore Purchases</strong> at the bottom of the <strong class="text-text">Shop</strong> tab. The app checks
                Apple's records again and delivers anything you paid for but did not receive. If the item still does not appear
                after 60 seconds, email us your Apple receipt and we will add it by hand.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">How do I restore purchases on a new device?</h3>
              <p>
                Sign in with the same account and tap <strong class="text-text">Restore Purchases</strong> at the bottom of the Shop tab.
                Everything you bought to keep comes back: equipment slots, banner packs, treasure trails and permanent XP boosts.
                Items you use up, such as coins and cooldown skips, are not restored this way.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">How do I request a refund?</h3>
              <p>
                Refunds for App Store purchases are handled directly by Apple. Go to
                <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light transition-colors">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>,
                sign in with your Apple ID, and request a refund for the purchase. If you need help explaining the problem to
                Apple, email us and we will give you the details to include.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">Are in-app purchases required to play?</h3>
              <p>
No. You can play all of Departure for free, including workout tracking, ranks, PRs, teams, monster battles and a
                free Future Self image every week. Purchases are optional extras such as more equipment slots, XP boosts and
                premium team banners.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Future Self / AI -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text mb-4">Future Self &amp; AI Images</h2>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">My future-self image didn't generate</h3>
              <p>
                The AI image service sometimes fails because of a weak connection or a short outage. The app tells you when
                that happens, and you can try again from the same screen. If it fails three times in a row, close and reopen
                the app. Each account gets one free Future Self image every 7 days, and image credits from packs let you make more.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">Can I delete an AI-generated image?</h3>
              <p>
                Yes. The app does not have a button to delete a single image, so email us and we will remove it from our
                servers. Deleting your account removes all of your photos and AI images.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">Will my selfie be used to train AI models?</h3>
              <p>
                No. Your selfie is used only to make your own Future Self images. It is not used to train AI models, it is not
                shared with anyone for marketing, and we keep it only as long as the app needs it to show your images.
                See our <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
                for full details.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Teams & Battles -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text mb-4">Teams &amp; Battles</h2>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">How do I join a team?</h3>
              <p>
                Open the <strong class="text-text">Arena</strong> tab and tap <strong class="text-text">Join</strong>. You can
                enter an invite code from a friend or pick a public team from the list. You can belong to one team at a time.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">Why can't I fight the next monster?</h3>
              <p>
                The journey map is the path of 24 monsters your team fights, and the team must beat them in order. Only the
                Team Leader, or the Steward when the team has no elected leader, can start a fight. After each battle, win or
                lose, the team waits 24 hours before the next one. The time left is shown when you tap the monster, and a
                cooldown skip ends the wait early.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">How do I leave a team?</h3>
              <p>
                Open your team's stats page and tap <strong class="text-text">Leave</strong>. The player who created the team
                cannot leave it, but can delete the team from the same page.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text mb-4">Technical &amp; Bugs</h2>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">The app is crashing or freezing</h3>
              <p>
                Close the app fully and reopen it. If that does not help, restart your phone. If it still crashes,
                email us and tell us what you were doing when it happened. A screenshot or screen recording helps a lot.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">Notifications aren't showing up</h3>
              <p>
                In your iPhone's Settings app, open Notifications, then Departure, and make sure notifications are allowed.
                Then open the <strong class="text-text">Settings</strong> tab in Departure, tap
                <strong class="text-text">Workout Reminders</strong>, and check that reminders are turned on.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-text mb-2">My data isn't syncing across devices</h3>
              <p>
                Your data is saved to your account, so sign in with the same email on both devices. Pull down on the Home
                screen to load the latest data. If something is still missing, email us from your account email and we
                will look into it.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Legal links -->
        <div class="border-t border-surface-light/50 pt-8 mt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text mb-3">Legal</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li>
              <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light transition-colors">
                Terms of Use (Apple Standard EULA)
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Still need help -->
        <div class="border-t border-surface-light/50 pt-8 mt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text mb-3">Still need help?</h2>
          <p>
            Email us at
            <a href="mailto:departure@engagequalia.com" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light transition-colors">
              departure@engagequalia.com
            </a>
            and include:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-2 mt-3">
            <li>The email address on your Departure account</li>
            <li>Your device model and iOS version</li>
            <li>A description of the issue, ideally with a screenshot or screen recording</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4">
            We usually reply within one or two business days.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
